  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnspacing=\"1.4ex\" columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> is differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then"
  },
