  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><br />Since, <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, therefore it is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />As <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> exists finitely<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> exists finitely<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math> exists finitely<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math>"
